  "releaseNotes": "Added a new Numerics.NET.Statistics.ProcessControl namespace with support for Statistical Process Control (SPC), including Individuals/Moving Range, X-bar/R, X-bar/S, p, np, c, u, EWMA, and CUSUM charts. The new API supports baseline analysis via Analyze(), deployment and persistence via Deploy() / JSON, later monitoring via Apply(...), built-in rule evaluation, and capability analysis with optional diagnostics.",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": true,
  "summary": "Numerics.NET - math, statistics, and data analysis libraries for .NET.",
